*.pyc

# Generated diagrams are regenerable and never committed: run an example
# generator with an output directory of your choosing.
diagrams/
out/
*.excalidraw
!plugin/skills/excalidraw-diagram/references/*.excalidraw

# The rendered viewer is regenerable from the committed _map.json and the vendored
# template, so it is built rather than committed (the upstream ADR-0034 posture).
requirements/_map.html

