# Senate deliberation posters and the generators that make them. They record two
# specific runs (the bundles in the Senate corpus are the source of truth), so they are
# local: nothing about one deliberation belongs in what the plugin ships, and CI must
# not carry a generator for a picture with one reader. The generator sits beside its
# output so the picture stays regenerable instead of becoming an orphan file.
docs/make_senate_*.py
docs/senate_*.html
docs/senate_*.png
